From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SuperKali <hello@superkali.me>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 21:43:44 +0200
Subject: arm64: dts: mediatek: supply BPI-R3 Mini Wi-Fi calibration

The board stores no MT7986 calibration: the i2c 24c02 ships blank, the
NAND factory region is a UBI PEB and the eMMC one holds no mt76 blob, so
mt76 falls back to the generic bin and the SoC resets the moment the
radio is brought up. Inline the calibration OpenWrt carries instead.

Signed-off-by: SuperKali <hello@superkali.me>
